{"schema":"hsr-dialogue.v1","entryId":"simulated-universe","chapterId":"event-rogue-62","referenceCommit":"312b4597691e0a29cf9828a15b592757dba86949","textReferenceCommit":"312b4597691e0a29cf9828a15b592757dba86949","sourceIds":["event-rogue-62"],"missing":0,"rows":[{"id":"simulated-universe-event-rogue-62-talk-403815452-line","entryId":"simulated-universe","chapterId":"event-rogue-62","missionId":"event-rogue-62","mission":"초월의 거울 (1)","scene":"초월의 거울 (1)","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"당신은 「초월의 거울」의 거대한 조각을 보았다. 조각 아래에는 세 개의 촛불이 놓여있었다","talkId":403815452,"textHash":"17779749026534001889","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:62/talk-403815452","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"d50d4be46505fc7c","bwikiNextIds":[],"bwikiPage":"超验之镜（其一）","bwikiRevision":92654,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-9334","bwikiMission":"초월의 거울 (1)"},{"id":"simulated-universe-event-rogue-62-talk-403815456-line","entryId":"simulated-universe","chapterId":"event-rogue-62","missionId":"event-rogue-62","mission":"초월의 거울 (1)","scene":"초월의 거울 (1)","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"「참으로 오랫동안 이 깨진 거울에 갇혀 있었군」 거울을 안은 자가 말했다. 「『미(美)』를 믿는다면, 네 소원을 들어주겠노라」","talkId":403815456,"textHash":"5919672762375618020","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:62/talk-403815456","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"59f94161312af3e5","bwikiNextIds":[],"bwikiPage":"超验之镜（其一）","bwikiRevision":92654,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-9334","bwikiMission":"초월의 거울 (1)"},{"id":"simulated-universe-event-rogue-62-text-6806213887617381295-choice","entryId":"simulated-universe","chapterId":"event-rogue-62","missionId":"event-rogue-62","mission":"초월의 거울 (1)","scene":"초월의 거울 (1)","type":"choice","speaker":"","text":"원하는 것을 속으로 생각한다","talkId":null,"textHash":"6806213887617381295","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:62/text-6806213887617381295","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"c5f4cf92953aa82f","bwikiNextIds":["simulated-universe-event-rogue-62-text-13610392172481139705